sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Club representative
    participant W as Web app
    participant TS as Tournament service
    participant D as Database

    C->>W: Name, sport, team names
    W->>TS: createTournament(userId, name, sport, teams)
    TS->>TS: Check role is club representative
    TS->>TS: Check at least 2 teams, no duplicate names
    TS->>D: Insert TOURNAMENT and TEAM rows
    TS-->>W: Tournament created
    C->>W: Generate Bracket
    W->>TS: generateBracket(tournamentId)
    TS->>TS: rounds = log2 of next power of two
    TS->>TS: Pair teams for round 1, byes advance to round 2
    TS->>D: Insert BRACKET_MATCH rows with next_match_id links
    TS-->>W: Bracket
    W-->>C: Show bracket
